x-col overflow-hidden mx-[var(--chat-padding)]" data-message-id="lukCOhUW92in8N2y"><div class="grid grid-col-1 self-end"><div class="overflow-hidden bg-bolt-ds-bgTertiary px-4 py-3 rounded-lg"><div class="_MarkdownContent_1i9tg_54"><p dir="auto">Build Megh Live - a live streaming party app like Voxa Party with dark theme, purple pink gradient, home with live rooms grid, party room with 8 seats, bottom nav Home Party Live Chat Me</p></div></div></div></div><div class="relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden mx-[var(--chat-padding)]" data-message-id="ebe6a243-874f-4f40-ac2b-8425fb4dfa0e"><div class="grid grid-col-1"><div class="grid [&amp;&gt;*]:[grid-area:1/1/2/2]"><div class="pointer-events-none" style="height: auto;"></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><div class="flex items-center min-h-6.5 select-none"><i class="i-bolt:logos-bolt?mask w-[40px] -translate-x-3px"></i></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="_MarkdownContent_1i9tg_54"><p dir="auto">I'll build Megh Live ‚Äî a live streaming party app with a dark theme, purple-pink gradients, live rooms grid, party room with 8 seats, and bottom navigation. Let me start by creating the core structure.</p></div><div class="bg-bolt-ds-bgSecondary rounded-md overflow-clip"><div class="flex gap-2 px-3 pt-2"><i class="size-4.5 shrink-0 i-heroicons-solid:list-bullet text-bolt-ds-iconSecondary group-hover/button:text-bolt-ds-textPrimary transition-theme"></i><div>Plan</div></div><div class="bg-bolt-ds-bgSecondary m-px rounded-[calc(theme('borderRadius.md')-1px)] p-3 space-y-2.5"><div class="relative"><div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm transition-opacity duration-200"><div class="relative size-4.5 shrink-0"><div class="size-4.5 shrink-0 inset-0 absolute left-0 mt-px i-heroicons:check-circle text-bolt-ds-success" style="opacity: 1; filter: blur(0px); transform: none;"></div></div><div><span role="button" class="hover:underline cursor-pointer">Create types, mock data, and design system (CSS)</span></div></div><div style="height: 0px; margin-top: 0px;"></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm transition-opacity duration-200"><div class="relative size-4.5 shrink-0"><div class="size-4.5 shrink-0 inset-0 absolute left-0 mt-px i-heroicons:check-circle text-bolt-ds-success" style="opacity: 1; filter: blur(0px); transform: none;"></div></div><div><span role="button" class="hover:underline cursor-pointer">Build bottom navigation component</span></div></div><div style="height: 0px; margin-top: 0px;"></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm transition-opacity duration-200"><div class="relative size-4.5 shrink-0"><div class="size-4.5 shrink-0 inset-0 absolute left-0 mt-px i-heroicons:check-circle text-bolt-ds-success" style="opacity: 1; filter: blur(0px); transform: none;"></div></div><div><span role="button" class="hover:underline cursor-pointer">Build Home page with live rooms grid</span></div></div><div style="height: 0px; margin-top: 0px;"></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm transition-opacity duration-200"><div class="relative size-4.5 shrink-0"><div class="size-4.5 shrink-0 inset-0 absolute left-0 mt-px i-heroicons:check-circle text-bolt-ds-success" style="opacity: 1; filter: blur(0px); transform: none;"></div></div><div><span role="button" class="hover:underline cursor-pointer">Build Party room page with 8 seats</span></div></div><div style="height: 0px; margin-top: 0px;"></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm transition-opacity duration-200"><div class="relative size-4.5 shrink-0"><div class="size-4.5 shrink-0 inset-0 absolute left-0 mt-px i-heroicons:check-circle text-bolt-ds-success" style="opacity: 1; filter: blur(0px); transform: none;"></div></div><div><span role="button" class="hover:underline cursor-pointer">Build Live, Chat, and Me pages</span></div></div><div style="height: 0px; margin-top: 0px;"></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm transition-opacity duration-200"><div class="relative size-4.5 shrink-0"><div class="size-4.5 shrink-0 inset-0 absolute left-0 mt-px i-heroicons:check-circle text-bolt-ds-success" style="opacity: 1; filter: blur(0px); transform: none;"></div></div><div><span role="button" class="hover:underline cursor-pointer">Wire up App.tsx with routing and verify build</span></div></div><div style="height: auto; margin-top: 8px;"><div class="relative min-w-0 overflow-hidden"><div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2" style="opacity: 1; filter: blur(0px); transform: none; transform-origin: 0% 50% 0px;"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-2 group w-full cursor-pointer" role="button"><span class="i-ph:checks size-4.5 shrink-0 col-start-1 row-start-1 text-bolt-ds-success"></span><div class="group-hover:underline leading-6">Plan completed</div><div class="flex-1"></div><span class="opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 font-normal text-size-xs transition-[opacity,transform] duration-200 text-bolt-ds-brand">Open details</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="_MarkdownContent_1i9tg_54"><p dir="auto">Megh Live is built and the project compiles cleanly. Here's what you've got:</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Home</strong> ‚Äî A dark-themed landing screen with a purple-pink gradient identity, search bar, scrollable category filters, a featured "tonight" banner, a trending rooms carousel, and a 2-column grid of all live rooms. Tapping any room opens the party room.</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Party Room</strong> ‚Äî A full-screen immersive experience with the room's cover photo as a blurred backdrop. 8 seats arranged in a circle around a live equalizer animation. The host has a crown badge, occupied seats show mic status indicators (green = talking, red = muted), and empty seats show a "+" you can tap to join. There's live chat scrolling at the bottom, a floating-heart animation when you tap the heart button, and controls for chat input, gifts, and mic toggle.</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Live</strong> ‚Äî Stats dashboard showing total listeners and active rooms, a top-3 podium ranked by popularity, and the full grid of live rooms.</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Chat</strong> ‚Äî A conversation list with online friends at the top (green status dots), unread badges, and a full 1-on-1 chat view when you tap a thread, with message bubbles matching the gradient theme.</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Me</strong> ‚Äî Profile page with a gradient header, avatar with Pro Host badge, stats (likes, rooms, level), a premium upgrade banner, and a settings menu.</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Bottom Nav</strong> ‚Äî Five tabs (Home, Party, Live, Chat, Me) with the center Live button styled as a prominent gradient circle with a pulse-ring animation when active.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-bolt-ds-textTertiary"><span class="i-heroicons:information-circle size-3.5 shrink-0"></span><small>Image search powered by Pexels</small></div><div class="flex items-center gap-0.5 pt-1"><button class="flex items-center justify-center font-medium shrink-0 max-w-full leading-tight focus-visible:outline-2 disabled:op-50 relative disabled:cursor-not-allowed transition-colors focus-visible:shadow-sm bg-transparent [&amp;:hover:where(:not(:disabled))]:bg-bolt-ds-utilHover focus-visible:outline-bolt-ds-brandHover size-7 rounded-lg text-bolt-ds-textTertiary hover:text-bolt-ds-textPrimary min-h-11 min-w-11 media-mouse:min-h-0 media-mouse:min-w-0" type="button" aria-label="Copy response" data-state="closed"><div class=""><span class="i-heroicons:clipboard-document block size-4"></span></div></button><button class="flex items-center justify-center font-medium shrink-0 max-w-full leading-tight focus-visible:outline-2 disabled:op-50 relative disabled:cursor-not-allowed transition-colors focus-visible:shadow-sm bg-transparent [&amp;:hover:where(:not(:disabled))]:bg-bolt-ds-utilHover focus-visible:outline-bolt-ds-brandHover size-7 rounded-lg hover:text-bolt-ds-textPrimary text-bolt-ds-textTertiary min-h-11 min-w-11 media-mouse:min-h-0 media-mouse:min-w-0" type="button" aria-label="Good response" data-state="closed"><div class=""><span class="i-heroicons:hand-thumb-up block size-4"></span></div></button><button class="flex items-center justify-center font-medium shrink-0 max-w-full leading-tight focus-visible:outline-2 disabled:op-50 relative disabled:cursor-not-allowed transition-colors focus-visible:shadow-sm bg-transparent [&amp;:hover:where(:not(:disabled))]:bg-bolt-ds-utilHover focus-visible:outline-bolt-ds-brandHover size-7 roun