Add:</p>
<ul>
<li dir="auto">capacitor.config.json with appId com.meghlive.streaming</li>
<li dir="auto">Android platform</li>
<li dir="auto">Make it ready to build APK for Play Store</li>
<li dir="auto">Add splash screen and app icon</li>
</ul></div></div></div></div><div class="relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden mx-[var(--chat-padding)]" data-message-id="e1592c78-a528-401c-a152-b3509696148a"><div class="grid grid-col-1"><div class="grid [&amp;&gt;*]:[grid-area:1/1/2/2]"><div class="pointer-events-none" style="height: auto;"></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><div class="flex items-center min-h-6.5 select-none"><i class="i-bolt:logos-bolt?mask w-[40px] -translate-x-3px"></i></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="_MarkdownContent_1i9tg_54"><p dir="auto">I'll set up Capacitor to turn Megh Live into an Android app. Let me install the dependencies, configure everything, and add the Android platform.</p></div><div class="bg-bolt-ds-bgSecondary rounded-md overflow-clip"><div class="flex gap-2 px-3 pt-2"><i class="size-4.5 shrink-0 i-heroicons-solid:list-bullet text-bolt-ds-iconSecondary group-hover/button:text-bolt-ds-textPrimary transition-theme"></i><div>Plan</div></div><div class="bg-bolt-ds-bgSecondary m-px rounded-[calc(theme('borderRadius.md')-1px)] p-3 space-y-2.5"><div class="relative"><div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm transition-opacity duration-200"><div class="relative size-4.5 shrink-0"><div class="size-4.5 shrink-0 inset-0 absolute left-0 mt-px i-heroicons:check-circle text-bolt-ds-success" style="opacity: 1; filter: blur(0px); transform: none;"></div></div><div><span role="button" class="hover:underline cursor-pointer">Install Capacitor packages and build web assets</span></div></div><div style="height: 0px; margin-top: 0px;"></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm transition-opacity duration-200"><div class="relative size-4.5 shrink-0"><div class="size-4.5 shrink-0 inset-0 absolute left-0 mt-px i-heroicons:check-circle text-bolt-ds-success" style="opacity: 1; filter: blur(0px); transform: none;"></div></div><div><span role="button" class="hover:underline cursor-pointer">Create capacitor.config.json with appId and settings</span></div></div><div style="height: 0px; margin-top: 0px;"></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm transition-opacity duration-200"><div class="relative size-4.5 shrink-0"><div class="size-4.5 shrink-0 inset-0 absolute left-0 mt-px i-heroicons:check-circle text-bolt-ds-success" style="opacity: 1; filter: blur(0px); transform: none;"></div></div><div><span role="button" class="hover:underline cursor-pointer">Add Android platform</span></div></div><div style="height: 0px; margin-top: 0px;"></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm transition-opacity duration-200"><div class="relative size-4.5 shrink-0"><div class="size-4.5 shrink-0 inset-0 absolute left-0 mt-px i-heroicons:check-circle text-bolt-ds-success" style="opacity: 1; filter: blur(0px); transform: none;"></div></div><div><span role="button" class="hover:underline cursor-pointer">Generate app icon and splash screen resources</span></div></div><div style="height: 0px; margin-top: 0px;"></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm transition-opacity duration-200"><div class="relative size-4.5 shrink-0"><div class="size-4.5 shrink-0 inset-0 absolute left-0 mt-px i-heroicons:check-circle text-bolt-ds-success" style="opacity: 1; filter: blur(0px); transform: none;"></div></div><div><span role="button" class="hover:underline cursor-pointer">Configure Android for Play Store and sync</span></div></div><div style="height: auto; margin-top: 8px;"><div class="relative min-w-0 overflow-hidden"><div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2" style="opacity: 1; filter: blur(0px); transform: none; transform-origin: 0% 50% 0px;"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-2 group w-full cursor-pointer" role="button"><span class="i-ph:checks size-4.5 shrink-0 col-start-1 row-start-1 text-bolt-ds-success"></span><div class="group-hover:underline leading-6">Plan completed</div><div class="flex-1"></div><span class="opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 font-normal text-size-xs transition-[opacity,transform] duration-200 text-bolt-ds-brand">Open details</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="_MarkdownContent_1i9tg_54"><p dir="auto">Megh Live is now fully configured as an Android app. Here's what was set up:</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Capacitor configuration</strong> ‚Äî <code node="[object Object]">capacitor.config.json</code> with appId <code node="[object Object]">com.meghlive.streaming</code>, app name "Megh Live", dark splash screen, and production-ready settings (no debug web views, HTTPS scheme).</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Android platform</strong> ‚Äî Full native Android project added with all Gradle configuration. The release build type is configured with debug signing for now (you'll need to generate a proper keystore for actual Play Store submission).</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>App icon</strong> ‚Äî A custom gradient equalizer icon matching Megh Live's purple-pink branding, generated as PNGs across all 5 density buckets (mdpi through xxxhdpi) for both standard and round icons, plus adaptive icon foreground layers.</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Splash screen</strong> ‚Äî Dark background with the Megh Live equalizer logo, generated in both portrait and landscape across all density buckets. Shows for 2 seconds on launch then auto-hides.</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Permissions</strong> ‚Äî Internet (required), plus microphone and audio permissions for the live streaming features, and vibration for notifications.</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>NPM scripts added:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li dir="auto"><code node="[object Object]">npm run cap:sync</code> ‚Äî rebuild web assets and sync to Android</li>
<li dir="auto"><code node="[object Object]">npm run cap:open</code> ‚Äî open the project in Android Studio</li>
<li dir="auto"><code node="[object Object]">npm run apk:debug</code> ‚Äî build a debug APK</li>
<li dir="auto"><code node="[object Object]">npm run apk:release</code> ‚Äî build a release APK</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">To build the APK, run <code node="[object Object]">npm run apk:debug</code> (for testing) or <code node="[object Object]">npm run apk:release</code> (for Play Store). The output APK will be at <code node="[object Object]">android/app/build/outputs/apk/debug/</code> or <code node="[object Object]">.../release/</code>. For actual Play Store submission, you'll need to create a keystore and replace the <code node="[object Object]">signingConfig</code> in <code node="[object Object]">android/app/build.gradle</code> with your own signing config.</p></div><button class="justify-center font-medium shrink-0 min-w-0 max-w-full rounded-md focus-visible:outline-2 disabled:op-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed transition-colors focus-visible:shadow-sm bg-transparent [&amp;:hover:where(:not(:disabled))]:bg-bolt-ds-utilHover text-bolt-ds-textPrimary focus-visible:outline-bolt-ds-brandHover gap-1 text-sm w-full flex items-start py-1 hover:bg-transparent px-0 group/button text-left h-auto relative" type="button"><div class="min-w-0 flex-1 flex items-start gap-2 group-hover/button:[mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_calc(100%_-_120px),transparent_calc(100%_-_56px))]"><div class="h-6 flex items-center"><i class="size-4.5 shrink-0 text-bolt-ds-iconSecondary group-hover/button:text-bolt-ds-textPrimary transition-theme i-heroicons-outline:command-line"></i></div><div class="text-bolt-ds-textSecondary group-hover/button:text-bolt-ds-textPrimary transition-theme font-normal text-left overflow-hidden"><div class="flex min-h-6 items-center gap-2 leading-6 truncate"><div class="truncate shrink-0 max-w-full">Verify project still builds after changes</div></div></div></div><span class="mt-0.5 pr-1 opacity-0 group-hover/button:opacity-100 font-normal text-size-xs transition-opacity duration-200 text-bolt-ds-brand absolute right-0"><div class="flex items-center"><span>Open</span><span class="inline-block i-ph:caret-right text-bolt-ds-brand size-3 shrink-0 ml-1"></span></div></spa