Route: /admin-megh-2024 (hidden route, only super admin can access)
Super Admin Login:
Email: admin@meghlive.com
Password: MeghAdmin@2024
ADMIN FEATURES TO BUILD:</p>
<ol>
<li dir="auto">Dashboard:</li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li dir="auto">Total Users, Total Live Now, Total Income Today, Pending Withdraws</li>
<li dir="auto">Graphs with charts</li>
</ul>
<ol start="2">
<li dir="auto">User Management:</li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li dir="auto">All users list with search</li>
<li dir="auto">Ban/Unban user</li>
<li dir="auto">Add/Remove coins/diamonds</li>
<li dir="auto">View user details, level, followers</li>
<li dir="auto">Make user as Host</li>
</ul>
<ol start="3">
<li dir="auto">Live Management:</li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li dir="auto">See all live rooms in real-time</li>
<li dir="auto">Force stop any live</li>
<li dir="auto">Set any live as Featured/Top</li>
<li dir="auto">View live reports</li>
</ul>
<ol start="4">
<li dir="auto">Host Management:</li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li dir="auto">Approve new hosts</li>
<li dir="auto">Set host level and salary</li>
<li dir="auto">Host earning reports</li>
</ul>
<ol start="5">
<li dir="auto">Finance Management:</li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li dir="auto">All coin purchase history</li>
<li dir="auto">Diamond exchange rate control (you can change price)</li>
<li dir="auto">Withdraw requests list - Approve/Reject button</li>
<li dir="auto">Income reports daily/monthly</li>
</ul>
<ol start="6">
